  "html": "<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Snap</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: <u>Hey</u> to long waves <u>balance</u>.</h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/234\">Moose Flores</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons start a full hey - lefts in center, rights on ends</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - gentlespoons face in, ladles face out</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - gentlespoons cross while ladles loop right</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance the ring</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners California twirl ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>I had a vision of dancers milling about, then suddenly snapping into formation. This became the full <u>hey</u> into long waves <u>balance</u>.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
